I take my phone.
I open my calendar.
I look at Thursday.
I suddenly see a problem.
I have an appointment at the hairdresser at half past four.
My coffee with Nina is also at half past four!
I immediately send a text message to Nina.
I write: "Hi Nina, sorry."
"I have a hairdresser appointment on Thursday at half past four."
"Do you have time at six o'clock instead?"
Nina replies very quickly.
She writes: "No problem!"
"See you at six o'clock."
I smile and change the time in the calendar.
Now my Thursday fits perfectly.
